%% ---- The state field is system-managed: each move is a rule and a saga ----
%% Nobody changes a state by hand. Recording the time a move depends on starts
%% the saga that sets the state; generated by the state-rule migration.
%%field EMPLOYEE.active_at help: When the move to ACTIVE was recorded on this employee. Recording it moves an employee from DRAFT to ACTIVE: the workflows set the status, which nobody changes by hand.
%%field EMPLOYEE.on_leave_at help: When the move to ON LEAVE was recorded on this employee. Recording it moves an employee from ACTIVE to ON LEAVE: the workflows set the status, which nobody changes by hand.
%%field EMPLOYEE.suspended_at help: When the move to SUSPENDED was recorded on this employee. Recording it moves an employee from ON LEAVE to SUSPENDED: the workflows set the status, which nobody changes by hand.
%%field EMPLOYEE.notice_period_at help: When the move to NOTICE PERIOD was recorded on this employee. Recording it moves an employee from SUSPENDED to NOTICE PERIOD: the workflows set the status, which nobody changes by hand.
%%field EMPLOYEE.separated_at help: When the move to SEPARATED was recorded on this employee. Recording it moves an employee from NOTICE PERIOD to SEPARATED: the workflows set the status, which nobody changes by hand.
